request.description:
Creates one subject and one face row per image, returning a presigned S3 PUT URL for each.

**Body** — 1 to 10 images. `contentType` must be `image/jpeg`, `image/png`, or `image/webp`.

```json
{
  "images": [
    { "name": "front.jpg", "contentType": "image/jpeg" },
    { "name": "left.png",  "contentType": "image/png" }
  ]
}
```

The `faces` array comes back in the same order as `images`.

**Response**

```json
{
  "subject_id": "…",
  "status": "pending",
  "faces": [
    { "face_id": "…", "status": "pending", "upload_url": "https://…", "headers": { "Content-Type": "image/jpeg" } }
  ],
  "expires_at": "…"
}
```
